WEBVTT

00:00.001 --> 00:00.002
♪Florsheim monster

00:00.001 --> 00:00.002
♪Tighter, Tighter

00:00.001 --> 00:00.002
♪Florsheim monster

00:00.003 --> 00:00.004
♪Devilcat

00:00.003 --> 00:00.004
♪Water is like the mother of Gaia

00:00.003 --> 00:00.004
♪Delz

00:00.005 --> 00:00.006
♪Florsheim monster

00:00.005 --> 00:00.006
- - ♪we'll never do anything
like this to you again, Mr. Red.

00:00.005 --> 00:00.006
♪The Rules of the Ward

00:00.007 --> 00:00.008
♪P-chan Custom

00:00.007 --> 00:00.008
♪Dry, muthasucka, dry!

00:00.009 --> 00:01.956
♪A New Form of Discrimination is Born.

00:01.980 --> 00:04.080
In the mountains somewhere near Kawasaki,

00:04.980 --> 00:08.189
a team meeting is being held this day

00:08.190 --> 00:10.750
by the terrifying demons of Florsheim.

00:11.430 --> 00:13.649
Our terror squad is now complete.

00:13.650 --> 00:16.480
We must report this to
Master Vamp immediatley.

00:19.450 --> 00:20.899
We'll have to bring him the
head of our sworn enemy,

00:20.900 --> 00:23.250
Astro Fighter Sunred.

00:23.750 --> 00:25.190
So be it.

00:26.220 --> 00:29.039
Animal Soldiers, sally forth!

00:29.040 --> 00:30.140
Yeah!

02:05.630 --> 02:07.099
And I forgot to get water.

02:07.100 --> 02:10.420
Damn it, I should have gone
to the convenience store first.

02:10.820 --> 02:17.230
They don't sell my favorite one liter barley
tea pack for 98 cents anywhere else after all.

02:17.950 --> 02:21.480
Vending machines charge
a buck twenty for 350ml.

02:21.980 --> 02:24.979
Normally I wouldn't be
bawling over this kind of shit,

02:24.980 --> 02:27.261
but I just had to go piss
away 250 on pachinko, didn't I.

02:28.250 --> 02:30.169
Come on, let's go together!

02:30.170 --> 02:32.029
It'll be like a family trip.

02:32.030 --> 02:33.729
I'll pass.

02:33.730 --> 02:36.319
I've only got about 50 bucks
left of what Kayoko gave me.

02:36.320 --> 02:39.920
That means I have to budget myself
to ten bucks a day until she gets back.

02:40.850 --> 02:44.050
My pork bowl would get cold if I went
back to the convenience store now, though.

02:44.650 --> 02:48.680
They sell 500ml Oolong tea bottles for a buck
over at the bento place near the apartment,

02:49.150 --> 02:51.769
but it would be somewhat rude to go into a bento
store and come out with just a bottle of Oolong tea,

02:51.770 --> 02:53.920
when I bought a pork bowl from Yoshidaya.

02:54.840 --> 02:56.879
The tap water at the
apartment tastes bad too.

02:56.880 --> 03:00.360
Not mentioning that it still tastes like
chlorine since the property is relatively new.

03:00.730 --> 03:03.239
Wait a minute, I still have the water that
I've been saving in case of an emergency.

03:03.240 --> 03:04.559
I'll just drink that.

03:04.560 --> 03:06.050
What the, the door is open.

03:06.750 --> 03:10.020
That's odd, I could have
sworn I locked the door.

03:11.630 --> 03:13.279
I can't find the water bottle.

03:13.280 --> 03:15.370
I don't remember drinking it.

03:15.590 --> 03:18.590
Oh well, I guess I'll just
have to drink tap water.

03:20.580 --> 03:21.660
What happened to the water?

03:21.980 --> 03:23.606
Did they turn off the water or something?

03:23.630 --> 03:27.460
Damn it, I should have just gotten
something from the vending machine.

03:28.690 --> 03:29.799
Sold out?

03:29.800 --> 03:31.429
But they just had stuff a minute ago.

03:31.430 --> 03:34.830
Wait, they're all sold out
except for the red bean soup!

03:36.250 --> 03:41.379
There's no way in hell red bean soup
and a pork bowl would go well together.

03:41.380 --> 03:45.260
But there aren't any more vending machines around
here unless I go back toward the train station.

03:47.390 --> 03:49.640
Shit.

03:51.550 --> 03:53.490
This is adding insult to injury.

03:55.320 --> 03:56.699
How are they doing laundry here?

03:56.700 --> 03:58.269
I thought they shut off
the water in the area.

03:58.270 --> 03:59.639
Did they only turn off the water
to our apartment or something?

03:59.640 --> 04:01.520
I don't see any notices
about a water blockage.

04:01.750 --> 04:05.490
What the, why the hell are
our water valves all closed shut?

04:09.960 --> 04:12.530
Punkass bitches...

04:17.770 --> 04:20.970
Turn it tighter this time, Devilcat.

04:21.370 --> 04:22.370
Okay.

04:23.360 --> 04:25.139
That's it, tighter.

04:25.140 --> 04:26.500
What the hell are you runts doing?

04:26.850 --> 04:27.680
Run!

04:27.681 --> 04:28.790
Stop right there!

04:29.990 --> 04:31.299
Devilcat!

04:31.300 --> 04:34.239
Don't worry about me, save yourselves!

04:34.240 --> 04:36.820
We couldn't possibly do that...

04:39.440 --> 04:42.030
What are you punks up to this time?

04:44.090 --> 04:46.309
Tell me what in the hell possessed
you to turn off someone's water supply.

04:46.310 --> 04:47.290
Spit it!

04:47.291 --> 04:52.190
Well, the most important resource
to any organism on Earth is water.

04:53.480 --> 04:57.729
Yeah, even you wouldn't
survive without water, Mr. Red.

04:57.730 --> 04:58.750
You numbskulls!

04:58.750 --> 05:01.120
Do you really think that warrants
turning off someone's water supply?

04:58.751 --> 05:00.300
Ow!

05:00.300 --> 05:01.290
Say "no" to violence!

05:01.291 --> 05:04.126
In case you have't noticed, you're
in no position to tell me what to do!

05:04.150 --> 05:06.789
Wait, was it you guys that stole
the water bottle from my bag too?

05:06.790 --> 05:07.750
Y-Yeah.

05:07.751 --> 05:09.529
And all the drinks from
the vending machine?

05:09.530 --> 05:10.649
T-That's right.

05:10.650 --> 05:12.825
I had to buy red bean
soup because of you punks!

05:12.826 --> 05:14.499
Ow!

05:14.500 --> 05:15.609
You actually <i>bought</i> that?

05:15.610 --> 05:16.230
What?

05:16.231 --> 05:17.889
We left the red bean
soup behind thinking that

05:17.890 --> 05:20.579
you'd know better than to buy it
no matter how thirsty you were.

05:20.580 --> 05:22.439
Well sor-ry for not being any better!

05:22.440 --> 05:25.119
What kind of an idiot do you take
me for? Do I look like an idiot to you?

05:25.120 --> 05:26.769
Stop it, you're hurting me!

05:26.770 --> 05:29.999
Next time you punks pull something like this,
I'm really going to beat your punk asses!

05:30.000 --> 05:32.739
We won't do it anymore,
even if you ask us to!

05:32.740 --> 05:33.759
You better not be lying.

05:33.760 --> 05:34.789
We swear,

05:34.790 --> 05:37.859
we'll never do anything like
this to you again, Mr. Red.

05:37.860 --> 05:39.059
Now get outta here.

05:39.060 --> 05:40.060
Yes, sir.

05:40.490 --> 05:41.699
Hey, Usa.

05:41.700 --> 05:42.800
Go for it!

05:43.250 --> 05:44.170
Stop right there you punk!

05:44.171 --> 05:45.411
We have your red bean soup now!

05:45.810 --> 05:48.410
Hope you enjoy dying of thirst!

05:53.180 --> 05:55.420
Damn it, they got away.

06:06.760 --> 06:09.289
We offer you these gifts in return for
your approval of us, the Animal Soldiers.

06:09.290 --> 06:12.630
Though the plan was actually
to bring you Red's head.

06:15.110 --> 06:16.949
So, what <i>is</i> all this?

06:16.950 --> 06:19.869
Animal Soliders, the minions of
the devil, should not be taken lightly!

06:19.870 --> 06:22.570
What will they be scheming next?

06:33.960 --> 06:36.379
I wonder what Delz is eating.

06:36.380 --> 06:38.129
Who knows.

06:38.130 --> 06:39.309
Okra, okra!

06:39.310 --> 06:43.560
You really should be a bit more
sensitive to the situation here, Tiser...

06:43.710 --> 06:44.620
Delz.

06:44.621 --> 06:48.329
Not much is known about this monster other than
the fact that he was delivered from Florsheim HQ

06:48.330 --> 06:50.049
via Cool Express delivery.

06:50.050 --> 06:54.179
His moving in and the disappearance
of Mii, the local kitty, are intertwined,

06:54.180 --> 06:56.500
if not by coincidence.

06:59.000 --> 07:02.349
If things continue this way, Master
Vamp, something tragic is bound to happen!

07:02.350 --> 07:03.559
Don't even go there!

07:03.560 --> 07:05.139
Sorry.

07:05.140 --> 07:07.479
I guess there's no
other way, I'll have to...

07:07.480 --> 07:09.950
Why the hell are you
coming to me of all people?!

07:10.150 --> 07:11.869
Well we have problems with a monster...

07:11.870 --> 07:13.899
He's <i>your guys'</i> monster isn't he?

07:13.900 --> 07:15.059
Welcome, Vamp.

07:15.060 --> 07:16.239
He doesn't need any tea.

07:16.240 --> 07:17.419
Oh, Mrs. Red,

07:17.420 --> 07:19.129
I mean, Kayoko.

07:19.130 --> 07:20.649
You really didn't have to bring any.

07:20.650 --> 07:21.859
Oh, it's my pleasure.

07:21.860 --> 07:24.439
Do you want to be buried alive, punk?

07:24.440 --> 07:26.360
I thought it would be rude
to come empty-handed,

07:26.550 --> 07:30.019
so I brought over some stewed
squid and daikon we made.

07:30.020 --> 07:31.549
You shouldn't have.

07:31.550 --> 07:33.389
Let me go put this in a different
container so you can take yours back.

07:33.390 --> 07:36.089
Oh, don't bother with it.

07:36.090 --> 07:37.419
I'll just come back to
pick it up another time.

07:37.420 --> 07:39.100
Who said you can come back?

07:40.650 --> 07:44.069
So, what kind of a monster
are we talking about?

07:44.070 --> 07:47.479
Well, we're not actually all that sure.

07:47.480 --> 07:51.419
If the rumors are true, Delz is
supposed to be this awesome monster,

07:51.420 --> 07:54.619
but not even our organization
knows much about him.

07:54.620 --> 07:58.139
Not mentioning that he got into
our ceiling top while we were away.

07:58.140 --> 08:01.039
So you don't even know
what kind of monster it is?

08:01.040 --> 08:03.219
Well he's kind of scary.

08:03.220 --> 08:05.369
He doesn't answer when we talk to him,

08:05.370 --> 08:06.160
and I think little Mii was eaten-

08:06.161 --> 08:07.859
Did you just say eaten?

08:07.860 --> 08:09.199
Um, forget what I just said.

08:09.200 --> 08:12.639
So you're telling me to check on this
guy, but what if something happens to me?

08:12.640 --> 08:15.899
That would help our world
domination cause, actually.

08:15.900 --> 08:18.999
If you think about it, you're going to have
to fight Delz at some point or another.

08:19.000 --> 08:19.790
You...

08:19.791 --> 08:22.919
What's the big deal? Just go take a look.

08:22.920 --> 08:25.369
He did help us move last time,

08:25.370 --> 08:27.139
and we're somewhat obliged
to help since they live nearby.

08:27.140 --> 08:29.169
Um, well...

08:29.170 --> 08:31.570
I don't know if I should be saying this,

08:32.070 --> 08:35.049
but wouldn't it be best for you to
deal with this as soon as possible?

08:35.050 --> 08:36.260
What kind of advice is that?!

08:37.350 --> 08:39.020
I'm home.

08:39.420 --> 08:41.859
Mr. Red decided to help us out.

08:41.860 --> 08:43.749
Thank you for helping us!

08:43.750 --> 08:45.649
So where is this guy?

08:45.650 --> 08:47.110
Right this way.

08:47.630 --> 08:48.859
He's in this room.

08:48.860 --> 08:49.909
He's here.

08:49.910 --> 08:52.479
You can access the area
above the ceiling through here.

08:52.480 --> 08:55.229
Hey Number Two, can you go get
the chair from the kitchen for me?

08:55.230 --> 08:56.230
Yes, sir, I mean...

08:58.540 --> 09:00.210
Please take a look.

09:02.210 --> 09:04.060
Huh? Somebody's here.

09:04.360 --> 09:06.120
Please excuse me, it seems we have company.

09:07.680 --> 09:10.380
Um, are you General Vamp?

09:10.680 --> 09:13.439
May I ask who you are?

09:13.440 --> 09:14.949
Well actually, hello,

09:14.950 --> 09:16.420
I'm Delz.

09:19.030 --> 09:21.389
I'm so sorry about all the trouble.

09:21.390 --> 09:25.299
Well remember how no one was there
when I evolved into my "perfect form?"

09:25.300 --> 09:27.740
That was such a lonely moment.

09:28.060 --> 09:29.969
Anyway, I got hungry after that,

09:29.970 --> 09:33.189
so I started walking around thinking I'd go buy
some bread at a convenience store or something,

09:33.190 --> 09:36.169
and then I got lost.

09:36.170 --> 09:40.460
Not to mention that I've never been in this area
before, I'm actually horribly bad with directions.

09:40.980 --> 09:43.549
I was basically lost all this time.

09:43.550 --> 09:46.089
Sorry for all the trouble.

09:46.090 --> 09:48.379
What's going on?

09:48.380 --> 09:50.410
Oh Vamp!

09:50.900 --> 09:53.649
I forgot to tell you, didn't I.

09:53.650 --> 09:57.119
Mii came back soon after that day.

09:57.120 --> 09:59.519
I'm so sorry for making all the fuss.

09:59.520 --> 10:03.539
She was missing her collar for some
reason, but she wasn't hurt anywhere,

10:03.540 --> 10:07.400
so I just bought her a new collar.

10:19.530 --> 10:22.830
You shouldn't put a collar on your kitty,
it makes it hard for them to breathe.

10:25.740 --> 10:27.679
Then the bone we saw earlier was...

10:27.680 --> 10:29.890
That was just a chicken wing.

10:33.970 --> 10:37.529
So Mr. Red just gave up
and went home, didn't he.

10:37.530 --> 10:40.949
I called HQ and asked them about
him, but they didn't seem to know either.

10:40.950 --> 10:43.359
He doesn't seem like a
bad monster to me, though.

10:43.360 --> 10:45.879
Where were you all day, Tiser?

10:45.880 --> 10:47.820
At a café, a maid café.

10:48.290 --> 10:49.879
Astro Fighter Sunred.

10:49.880 --> 10:52.119
This is a story about the
conflict between good and evil,

10:52.120 --> 10:54.830
which takes place in the city of Kawasaki.

10:59.800 --> 11:01.309
Hello there.

11:01.310 --> 11:03.969
Hello! What seems to be the problem?

11:03.970 --> 11:07.809
Well I talked to the
event advisors about it,

11:07.810 --> 11:10.680
but they think it'd be an unfair
adcantage over the other wards.

11:11.580 --> 11:13.109
I see.

11:13.110 --> 11:14.939
I guess we don't have a choice then.

11:14.940 --> 11:16.679
Yeah, sorry about that.

11:16.680 --> 11:18.710
Thanks for letting us know!

11:19.590 --> 11:23.569
They said you're not allowed to fly in
the ward's ball throwing competition.

11:23.570 --> 11:25.209
That's not fair!

11:25.210 --> 11:27.109
Being able to fly is as much a
part of someone's physical attributes

11:27.110 --> 11:29.910
as being tall or short!
